        {
          "id": 469839156,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Since I wrote the SOME/IP specification...\n\nNo, all SOME/IP length and types fields are only allowed in Network Byte Order. The patch in its current form would break the SOME/IP dissector.",
